# Paste a token from POST /api/users/auth/login (never commit real tokens)
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Get Single Product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/16

### Create new Product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "my book in programming",
  "description": "Description about my book in programming",
  "price": 8
}

### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/19
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "price": 16
}

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
